        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: 101 Dalmatians (1996 film), G-Force\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures, Jerry Bruckheimer Films\n- People: Dodie Smith\n- Works: The Hundred and One Dalmatians, 101 Dalmatians (1961 film)\n- Topics: film adaptations, family comedy adventure films\n\nFacts:\n- Dodie Smith published the novel The Hundred and One Dalmatians in 1956.\n- Walt Disney released an animated film adaptation of The Hundred and One Dalmatians in 1961.\n- 101 Dalmatians is a 1996 American live-action comedy adventure film based on Disney's 1961 animated adaptation of Dodie Smith's 1956 novel.\n- G-Force is a 2009 American family comedy adventure film produced by Walt Disney Pictures and Jerry Bruckheimer Films.",
